do not start any listener, do not use the port, and do not install anything.\n7. Write W/StrictGateBuild/report.md: each clause, its implementation line numbers, each receipt's rc, the default-mode diff result, and any clause that cannot be enforced from the committed receipt (name it; do not narrow the frozen clause). Yield the summary with the four rc values.\n\nLane bounds: leaf member — no subagent dispatch except your single labrat.\nJudged on: coverage, operability, calibration\nMilestone: kengaku r67 w1 (v1, 13 seats: build + attack): R67-C1 offline torch-pipeline-parallel grader probe (coverage, L0-capped); R67-C2 round-65 sqlite receipt gate strict mode (operability); frontier knowledge and lesson drafts; source re-read\n\nReport: write your scoped findings to .ufo/waves/round-67/w1/StrictGateBuild.md"
