e: kengaku r67 w1 (v1, 13 seats: build + attack): R67-C1 offline torch-pipeline-parallel grader probe (coverage, L0-capped); R67-C2 round-65 sqlite receipt gate strict mode (operability); frontier knowledge and lesson drafts; source re-read\n\nReport: write your scoped findings to .ufo/waves/round-67/w1/LessonDraft.md"
